[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 8641.11, "timestamp": "02:24:01", "text": "我更想变得更像西方人。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8642.71, "timestamp": "02:24:02", "text": "观众。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8647.27, "timestamp": "02:24:07", "text": "我对印度时区很适应。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8650.309, "timestamp": "02:24:10", "text": "东西，但可能呃，因为我就像"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8653.27, "timestamp": "02:24:13", "text": "早上直播之类的，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8655.51, "timestamp": "02:24:15", "text": "这些对印度人来说不太友好。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8658.07, "timestamp": "02:24:18", "text": "时间。所以，我就像在努力获得一个"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8662.95, "timestamp": "02:24:22", "text": "时区，嗯，嗯，哪个合适呢？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8667.07, "timestamp": "02:24:27", "text": "每个人都喜欢欧盟或北美类型，你"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8671.95, "timestamp": "02:24:31", "text": "知道。是的。以某种方式，所以早晨"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8674.19, "timestamp": "02:24:34", "text": "我没有时间"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8677.389, "timestamp": "02:24:37", "text": "我知道我甚至都没想过要直播。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8680.55, "timestamp": "02:24:40", "text": "6:30，但我只是需要"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8682.67, "timestamp": "02:24:42", "text": "来的人"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8685.469, "timestamp": "02:24:45", "text": "但这就是问题所在，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8688.63, "timestamp": "02:24:48", "text": "疼痛难忍，凌晨2点半到3点我睡不着。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8690.07, "timestamp": "02:24:50", "text": "一开始，经过一番起床后"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8696.23, "timestamp": "02:24:56", "text": "哇，这简直就是我的日程安排。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8698.51, "timestamp": "02:24:58", "text": "如今。我不做"}]